From dd798fb9cf6708fa66c1d7e6a27e6a8d88a65bbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shivani Raval <sraval@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 11 Mar 2025 10:29:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [JSW-31] jgs: add basic headers

Dummy headers required for basic ppboot build are added for jgs.
It was decided to separate jgs headers from other projects headers,
the jgs headers are places it embedded_specs/jgs folder.

Change-Id: I8fca4a9255a8a42c1e59e27470d0e4e6ba0cab5d
Signed-off-by: Shivani Raval <sraval@habana.ai>
---

